        "content": "<p>(I thought I start a thread like <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"113488\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/Lean.20in.20the.20wild/with/616105545\">#general &gt; Lean in the wild</a> )</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/tmkadamcz/status/2087553703406649661\">https://x.com/tmkadamcz/status/2087553703406649661</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/epoch-research/LeanOpenProblems\">https://github.com/epoch-research/LeanOpenProblems</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://bayes.net/assets/files/OEIS_open.pdf\">https://bayes.net/assets/files/OEIS_open.pdf</a> </p>\n<p>Takes a selection of problems from <br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/google-deepmind/formal-conjectures\">https://github.com/google-deepmind/formal-conjectures</a></p>",
        "id": 616159362,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Firsching",
        "timestamp": 1786561176
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://epoch.ai/latest/announcing-frontiermath-erdos\">https://epoch.ai/latest/announcing-frontiermath-erdos</a> </p>\n<p>Epoch has made a Lean Erdos Benchmark together with Thomas Bloom (who choose 68 of the open problems) and for 50 of those open problems, the Lean Formalization of Formal Conjectures was used!</p>",
        "id": 621535491,
        "sender_full_name": "Franz Huschenbeth",
        "timestamp": 1788473296
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Hi! :)</p>\n<p>I've also got a PR open to contribute the remaining 18 back to FC.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/google-deepmind/formal-conjectures/pull/5229\">https://github.com/google-deepmind/formal-conjectures/pull/5229</a></p>",
        "id": 621561232,
        "sender_full_name": "Tom Adamczewski",
        "timestamp": 1788481164
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://x.com/tmkadamcz/status/2095785941193404457\">https://x.com/tmkadamcz/status/2095785941193404457</a><br>\nproposed proofs to koethe and mean-value-problem from our Wikipedia dir: </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/tadamcz/koethe\">https://github.com/tadamcz/koethe</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/tadamcz/mean-value-problem\">https://github.com/tadamcz/mean-value-problem</a></p>\n<p>At first glance they don't look like misformalisations to me</p>",
        "id": 621666298,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Firsching",
        "timestamp": 1788517921
    },
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Lean''s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">convention</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">makes</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`p''</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hold</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivially</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">so</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">formal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">conjecture</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">anything</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">weaker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">than</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">informal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">one</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">counterexample</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">uses</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`p''</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">so</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">it</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">refutes</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">informal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">conjecture</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stated</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">literature</span><span class=\"bp\">.'</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
